      "text": "Section 1. Prior order amended. Section 1(b) of prior Executive Order No. 16, dated July 26, 1978, as amended by Executive Order No. 78, dated October 5, 1984, is hereby repealed and Sections 1(c), (d), (e) and (f) are re-lettered (b), (c), (d) and (e) respectively.",
