        "density": 0.18856,
        "chars": 826,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 11.4
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        629,
        1628,
        1398,
        1916
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(a) (ii) The Commissioner shall be responsible for developing policy and strategy for the Inspector General system, for the preparation and allocation of a system-wide budget, and for the assignment, direction, and evaluation of all Inspector General personnel in the various agencies and departments. This responsibility shall be carried out, however, in a strict, regular, ongoing, meaningful and comprehensive consultation and collaboration with each agency head.",
